OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump ordered to answer questions under
OL,4,Aoath in BBC lawsuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a lawyer representing the BBC said
OL,7,Fin court that Trump was campaigning in
OL,8,FGeorgia that day and had "prioritised
OL,9,Fthat" over answering the questions.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
